{'symbol': 'MET', 'date': '2023-03-02 08:00:00', 'title': 'METLIFE INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF RAVEN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT', 'text': "WHIPPANY, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--METLIFE INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT (MIM), THE INSTITUTIONAL ASSET MANAGEMENT BUSINESS OF METLIFE, INC. (NYSE: MET), ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED ITS ACQUISITION OF ALTERNATIVE INVESTMENT FIRM RAVEN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT. ANNOUNCED IN FEBRUARY 2023, THE TRANSACTION ADDS APPROXIMATELY $2.1 BILLION TO MIM'S TOTAL ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT."}